# Facility Flooring — wp-content repository
#
# This repo tracks only the custom code written for this site plus project docs.
# Everything else (WordPress core, third-party plugins and themes, uploads, caches,
# backups) is either installed from its vendor or lives in the database / media
# library and is moved between environments with a migration tool. See README.md.
#
# Pattern: ignore everything at the root, then allow-list what we own.

/*

# Project files
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/.editorconfig
!/README.md
!/CHANGELOG.md
!/LICENSE
!/docs/

# Must-use plugins: only our own ff-*.php files, never throwaway ff-tmp-* scripts
!/mu-plugins/
/mu-plugins/*
!/mu-plugins/ff-*.php
/mu-plugins/ff-tmp-*

# Child theme only (parent Hello Elementor is installed from wordpress.org)
!/themes/
/themes/*
!/themes/Facility-Flooring/

# Never commit, wherever they appear
*.log
*.sql
*.sql.gz
*.wpress
*.zip
.env
.env.*
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.idea/
.vscode/
node_modules/
